  "decision": "Retain production thresholds. The pilot lacks independently verified condition labels and unreadable/blurred negatives; no threshold was selected from validation outcomes.",
  "notes": [
    "Primary results use only the owner-verified 191 nutrient and 30 serving strings; strict field-exact-v1 scoring, not semantic quantity accuracy.",
    "Expanded audit adds nine readable nutrient values and seven absent fields. Supplements, panel corners and capture-condition labels were reviewed by Codex, not independently human-verified.",
    "Variants are paired observations of 15 photographs, not 45 independent images. Holdout has only five products from the same supplied collection.",
    "Source photos, owner JSON and full generated reports remain local and gitignored. Artifact hashes refer to the original full pilot, not the isolated resume integration check.",
    "Study date uses the client date; raw machine timestamps are retained without correction in local artifacts.",
    "Production OCR, parsing and warning thresholds were not changed."
  ]
}
